<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov cotton imports fall 14.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov cotton imports fall 14.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's cotton imports reached 590,000 tonnes in the first 11 months of the year, down 14.4 percent compared to the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Imports in November alone were 40,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>China's cotton exports in the first 11 months slumped 72.4 percent to 4,493 tonnes from 20,930 tonnes in the same year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>There were no exports in November.</p>
</text>
